===Speak with Dr. Edward{{subst:void|<!--202180301-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Golden Hour|This wonderful dream has finally come to an end. Dr. Edward would like to hear your thoughts &mdash; go and talk with him. Oh, don't forget what Black Swan told you at the start: "The nature of this memory is special. Don't ruin the dreamscape experience for anyone else by spoiling the ending."}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

:{{DIcon|Разговор}} Dr. Edward
:'''Dr. Edward:''' Trailblazers from the Astral Express &mdash; Welcome to Dreamscape Sales Store!
:Is that usually how you welcome customers?
:'''Dr. Edward:''' Please excuse me. I struggle to think of an appropriate way of addressing such esteemed guests as yourselves.
:Long time no see, ol' big eye.
:'''Dr. Edward:''' Long time no see, diamond in the rough.
:'''Dr. Edward:''' You must be here to experience those dream bubbles. I've already made the necessary preparations. Be careful, though &mdash; we did pass the safety inspections stipulated by "Article 027-Damaged Faris" and "Article 076-Real Wasteland..."
:'''Dr. Edward:''' ...However, this dreamscape will feature unfiltered and unpolished fresh memories. It will make for a very vivid experience.
:'''Dr. Edward:''' Veteran gamers call this type of dream a "thrill-dream" &mdash; I don't know if you're into that kind of thing? If you feel any discomfort, please leave the dreamscape immediately and seek professional medical help.
:'''Dr. Edward:''' ...Luckily, I just so happen to be an excellent doctor, albeit a psychiatric one, haha! Let us begin. Please close your eyes, and rest your forehead on the dream bubble.
:(Touch the dream bubble)
:'''Dr. Edward:''' Oh yes, I nearly forgot &mdash; that elegant girl mentioned something before she left&mdash;
:'''???:''' "The nature of this memory is special. Don't ruin the dreamscape experience for anyone else by spoiling the ending."
:I'm not so sure about this...
:'''Dr. Edward:''' If you need time to prepare, we can humbly wait as long as you need.
:'''Dr. Edward:''' Are you ready to experience Miss Black Swan's dreamscape? Please close your eyes, and rest your forehead on the dream bubble.
:(Touch the dream bubble)
:Hang on a second...
:'''Dr. Edward:''' If you need time to prepare, we can humbly wait as long as you need.
:'''Dr. Edward:''' That's the end of Miss Black Swan's dream bubble. Are you satisfied with your experience?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How fascinating.
::'''Dr. Edward:''' I also found this dream suitably fascinating. You've gained joy from it. And Miss Black Swan surely also feels gratified, yes?
::'''Dr. Edward:''' If we meet again, I will pass your esteemed praise on to her.
::How boring.
::'''Dr. Edward:''' I understand. The dreamscape is inherently different for everyone, so inevitably there are some people who it won't suit.
::'''Dr. Edward:''' But, I also think Miss Black Swan must have her own reason for holding on to this dream bubble. And as an outsider, that is not my place to judge.
::It was kinda easy.
::'''Dr. Edward:''' Sure enough, those puzzles are going to be easy for a Trailblazer with the vast experience that you have.
::'''Dr. Edward:''' But I'm afraid that Miss Sparkle would argue: "We're Masked Fools, not Masked Geniuses!" ...haha.
::Sampo turned out to be...
